  abstract     = {
    The purpose of this chapter is to review the calculation f the stopping and
    the final range distribution of ions in matter. During the last thirty
    years there have been published scores of tables and books evaluating the
    parameters of energetic ion penetration of matter. Rarely have the authors
    of these reference works included any evaluation of the accuracy of the
    tabulated numbers. We have chosen to show the development of ion
